<p>Telekinetically energize the matter of all foes within <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 4, 5, 5, 6</acronym> squares at the molecular level, setting them ablaze. This does <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">281, 379, 454, 518, 575</acronym> fire damage over six turns.</p>